# Build trees for the two targets. Both live inside the project because its
# sources sit at the project root - PlatformIO's src_dir is `.` - so they are
# named here rather than relied on to be somewhere else.
build/
.pio/

# A captured serial log, when checking a board's run with `verify.py --log`.
serial.log

# NOT ignored, deliberately: .schema.uids.json. It is generator-maintained
# bookkeeping, but it is part of the wire contract - ignoring it means every
# fresh clone re-derives task uids from scratch and peers stop agreeing.
